        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Canon gives Harribel no Segunda Etapa.</strong> Hirviendo itself is canon &mdash; she boils away all water around her, including ice.</p><p>Water rises around you in a <strong>20-foot emanation</strong>, difficult terrain for enemies. Once per round when you hit with your spirit weapon you may push the target 5 feet. <strong>La Gota</strong> may be used as a <strong>60-foot line</strong> instead of a cone.</p><p>You also gain <strong>Trident</strong> and <strong>Hirviendo</strong>.</p>"
